flowchart TD
    A[1 · Current file: highest priority<br/>before-cursor and after-cursor content]:::focus
    A --> B[2 · Open neighbouring tabs<br/>most recently used files]
    B --> C[3 · Workspace search<br/>#codebase in VS Code chat; finds relevant code]
    C --> D[4 · Custom instructions<br/>copilot-instructions.md, *.instructions.md, AGENTS.md]
    D --> E[5 · Chat history<br/>earlier messages in this conversation]:::data
    classDef focus fill:#5B4BD6,stroke:#A99BFF,color:#ffffff
    classDef good fill:#1a2a12,stroke:#34d399,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef warn fill:#2a1a22,stroke:#f5b94a,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef risk fill:#2a1a1a,stroke:#fb7185,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef data fill:#162236,stroke:#5ec8f2,color:#e2e8f0
